  "type": "manhwa",
  "description": "Desperate to escape his painful past, 24-year-old Hyun-Oh has cut ties with everyone he once knew. But when he unexpectedly runs into Cha-Mi, his former high school friend, Hyun-Oh's world is turned upside down. He does everything in his power to push Cha-Ni away, only for Cha-Ni to insist on sticking around. With no other options, Hyun-Oh fakes a confession of love, hoping it will drive Cha-Ni away for good—only for Cha-Ni to admit he feels the same. \n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
